($q$B$q$,$q$03d4a598-d027-449a-896a-205d982f12c5$q$::uuid,$q$A3$q$,$q$For Quiz A, the z-score is (86-74)/8 = 12/8 = 1.5. For Quiz B, it's (62-52)/4 = 10/4 = 2.5. The student performed better on Quiz B relative to the class since their z-score was higher.$q$,$q$google$q$,$q${"sig":"1110","type":"A3"}$q$::jsonb,$q$7f27c20bcf2b06183197b972644c1432f296bd7d50fa1415c9d581e4fdc550ac$q$,$q$provisional_accept$q$,$q$accf82300d7abca7bed0f7bbc6a389da97190fada7caa7efe78f2c66626c0b5b$q$),
